/Author (Hunter Hughes)
/CreationDate (D\07220261112153046\05505\04700\047)
/Creator (H Heuristics PDF pipeline)
/Keywords (concept adoption\054 diffusion of innovations\054 Bass diffusion model\054 research impact\054 theory of change\054 social capital\054 independent citations\054 polycrisis resilience\054 preventive development economics\054 sustainable convergence\054 open\055access research\054 responsible metrics)
/ModDate (D\07220261112153046\05505\04700\047)
/Producer (ReportLab PDF Library \055 www\056reportlab\056com)
/Subject (This report presents the Global Concept Adoption Initiative\054 an H Heuristics research and outreach programme that shifts the organisation\047s emphasis from developing and publishing original concepts to helping them spread\054 be tested and be applied\056 It rests on a three\055step guiding principle\072 ideas can influence decisions\054 decisions can direct investment\054 and investment can change development trajectories\056 It draws on four existing assets \050intellectual capital\054 a digital presence\054 social capital and open publishing infrastructure\051 to share a connected system of six concepts\072 Polycrisis Resilience\054 Preventive Development Economics\054 Sustainable Convergence\054 Development Optimization\054 Human Vulnerability Reduction Economics and the Human Survivability Dividend\056)
/Title (Global Concept Adoption Initiative\072 Mobilizing Intellectual and Social Capital to Improve Humanity\047s Outlook This Century)
/Trapped /False
>>
